{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a complete, fully functional Shopify product page section for a premium men's footwear and luxury lifestyle brand. The design should feel editorial, modern, and minimal with a charcoal, ivory, and gold color palette.
    
    Overall Layout:
    
    Two-column layout on desktop: product media gallery on the left (55% width), product details on the right (45% width)
    Single column stacked layout on mobile with media on top, details below
    Max content width of 1400px centered on the page
    60px padding on desktop sides, 20px on mobile
    Background color: ivory/cream (#F5F2EE)
    Smooth scroll behavior throughout
    Left Column — Media Gallery:
    
    Large primary product image at top, full width of the column
    Aspect ratio 4:5 (portrait) for all images
    Image fit: cover, with transparent background support for PNG products
    Below the primary image, show a horizontal thumbnail strip with up to 8 thumbnails
    Each thumbnail is 72px wide, 90px tall, border-radius 4px, with a 2px gold (#C9A84C) border on hover and when active
    Clicking a thumbnail swaps the main image with a smooth crossfade transition (300ms ease)
    On mobile, replace the thumbnail strip with a swipeable carousel with dot pagination indicators at the bottom
    Include a zoom-on-hover effect for the main image on desktop (scale 1.08, overflow hidden, transition 400ms ease)
    Support video thumbnails with a play icon overlay (gold circle, white triangle)
    Sticky behavior: the media gallery sticks to the top of the viewport as the user scrolls through product details, stopping before the footer
    Right Column — Product Details:
    
    Top of column: product vendor name in small uppercase gold (#C9A84C) lettering, letter-spacing 0.15em, font-size 11px
    Product title: large serif or elegant sans-serif font, font-size 32px desktop / 24px mobile, color charcoal (#2C2C2C), font-weight 600, line-height 1.2
    Star rating row: 5-star display using gold filled/empty stars, show numeric rating (e.g. 4.8) and review count (e.g. 142 reviews) as a clickable link that scrolls to reviews section
    Price display: font-size 24px, font-weight 500, charcoal color; if on sale show original price struck through in muted gray (#999) and sale price in a warm red (#C0392B); show currency code beside price
    Thin horizontal divider (1px, #E0DDD8) after price
    Short product description: 2-3 lines max, font-size 14px, color #666, line-height 1.7; include a "Read more" toggle that expands the full description with smooth height animation
    Variant picker for Size: display as a grid of pill-shaped buttons (min-width 48px, height 40px, border-radius 24px); unselected state: white background, 1px border #D0CCC6, charcoal text; selected state: charcoal (#2C2C2C) background, white text; sold-out state: white background, diagonal strikethrough line using CSS, muted text color; hover state: light gold background tint (#FAF4E8)
    Size guide link: small text link in gold beside the "Size" label, opens a modal overlay with a size chart table
    Color variant picker if applicable: circular swatches 32px diameter, 2px border on selected in gold, tooltip showing color name on hover
    Quantity selector: minimal stepper with minus and plus buttons flanking a number input; buttons are 36px square, border 1px #D0CCC6, border-radius 4px; input width 48px centered
    Add to Cart button: full width, height 52px, background charcoal (#2C2C2C), white text, font-size 15px uppercase letter-spacing 0.1em, border-radius 4px; on hover background shifts to #3D3D3D; loading state shows a spinner replacing the text; success state briefly shows a checkmark before reverting
    Buy It Now button: full width, height 52px, background gold (#C9A84C), charcoal text, same typography as ATC button, border-radius 4px; hover darkens gold slightly
    Both buttons have a subtle box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.10)
    Below buttons: a row of trust badges (icons + text) for Free Shipping, Easy Returns, Authenticity Guaranteed — icons in gold, text in #888, font-size 12px, evenly spaced
    Thin divider
    Accordion sections for: Product Details, Shipping & Returns, Size & Fit — each with a plus/minus toggle icon in gold, smooth height animation open/close, border-bottom 1px #E0DDD8, padding 16px 0
    Social share row at the bottom: small icons for Instagram, Pinterest, Facebook, WhatsApp in charcoal, 24px each, spaced 12px apart, label "Share:" in muted text
    Sticky Add to Cart Bar:
    
    Appears after user scrolls past the main ATC button
    Fixed to bottom of viewport, full width, height 72px
    Background: white with subtle top border 1px #E0DDD8 and box-shadow upward
    Left side: product thumbnail (48px square, border-radius 4px) + product title truncated + selected variant
    Right side: price + Add to Cart button (same style but smaller, height 40px, auto width min 140px)
    Smooth slide-up animation on appear (translateY from 100% to 0, 300ms ease)
    Hides when user scrolls back up to the ATC button
    Below the Fold — Additional Sections:
    
